# Notebook outputs that contain pictures (memes, feature maps) are stripped when you commit, so they never
# reach GitHub. Your local notebooks keep them. Turn this on in a fresh clone with:
#   git config filter.strip-images.clean "python3 src/tools/strip_image_outputs.py"
#   git config filter.strip-images.smudge cat
#   git config filter.strip-images.required true
*.ipynb filter=strip-images
